WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:03,590
Secretary Xu

2
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:04,760
Director Chen, have you had a rest?

3
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:09,510
I'm very angry now, so let's have a meeting again

4
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:12,310
When Director Chen comes out and contacts me, Secretary Xu, can you check the person?

5
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,860
It doesn't matter what your ID number is. It doesn't matter.

6
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:22,050
Secretary Xu, did you listen? The sooner the better. Don’t be afraid.

7
00:00:22,570 --> 00:00:23,810
As long as everything you say is true

8
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:25,570
I promise to give you justice

9
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:30,680
Director Chen, how is it true?

10
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:32,280
The two old men were holding each other in bed

11
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,520
The flow of funds was also checked.

12
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:34,560
Thirty thousand yuan entered into account

13
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:37,400
Additional money that is inconsistent with the approved 320,000 yuan

14
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:40,440
Died into another person's account, Director Chen

15
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,280
These people should be shot

16
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,200
What era is it now?

17
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,120
There is such a thing

18
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,400
Can't even go to school

19
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,760
You can only come out and do this

20
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:47,720
What's this

21
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:50,500
Are you going to force them both to shoot?

22
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,700
Isn't this script wrong?

23
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:54,380
Xiaodian, I'm very happy that you think so. I promise you.

24
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:56,820
As long as you capture everything you have designed, you can look forward to it

25
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:59,220
As long as one is within reach, it will not intrude

26
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:06,850
Anyway, I definitely can’t give them any advantage. Don’t worry, I’ll take care of this matter. As long as they swallow it.

27
00:01:06,850 --> 00:01:07,890
I made them spit it all out

28
00:01:08,290 --> 00:01:10,090
You don’t have to do this anymore, right?

29
00:01:10,410 --> 00:01:11,650
Do you want to go back to school?
